o ponies\"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APolo2.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Feralpony.jpg/500px-Feralpony.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Feralpony.jpg/1280px-Feralpony.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Feralpony.jpg/500px-Feralpony.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"There is debate over whether the feral Chincoteague ponies of Assateague Island are horses or ponies","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFeralpony.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/ae/Tough_Love_-_Pony_%28Jump_on_It%29.png/250px-Tough_Love_-_Pony_%28Jump_on_It%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/ae/Tough_Love_-_Pony_%28Jump_on_It%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/ae/Tough_Love_-_Pony_%28Jump_on_It%29.png/250px-Tough_Love_-_Pony_%28Jump_on_It%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATough_Love_-_Pony_(Jump_on_It).png"}],"sounds":{}}}